OL,3,GNEWSAAnother property searched as
OL,4,Apolice look for body
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with Piatek's death, and a
OL,8,Ftrial is due to take place later this
OL,9,Fyear. Two people have been charged with
OL,10,Fmurder.
